hs 2.1 kg.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack\">\n    <div class=\"between\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Find your match</div>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Choose what matters most and we will highlight the best fit.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <label>What matters most?\n      <select id=\"priority\">\n        <option value=\"balance\">Balanced everyday use</option>\n        <option value=\"portability\">Portability and battery</option>\n        <option value=\"budget\">Lowest price</option>\n        <option value=\"performance\">Raw performance and storage</option>\n      </select>\n    </label>\n    <div id=\"pick\" class=\"alert\">\n      <strong>Aero 14</strong> offers the best balance of weight, battery life, screen and rating for everyday work.\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stack\">\n    <h2>Specifications</h2>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>Spec</th>\n            <th>Aero 14</th>\n            <th>Forge 16</th>\n            <th>Nimbus 13</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>Tagline</td><td>Light, bright, long-lasting</td><td>Desktop power on the go</td><td>Everything you need, for less</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Price</td><td class=\"num\">$1,299</td><td class=\"num\">$1,899</td><td class=\"num\">$999</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Weight</td><td class=\"num\">1.2 kg</td><td class=\"num\">2.1 kg</td><td class=\"num\">1.0 kg</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Battery</td><td class=\"num\">18 h</td><td class=\"num\">9 h</td><td class=\"num\">22 h</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Screen</td><td>14\" OLED</td><td>16\" IPS 165Hz</td><td>13\" IPS</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>CPU</td><td>8-core, 15 W</td><td>16-core, 55 W</td><td>6-core, 15 W</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>RAM</td><td class=\"num\">16 GB</td><td class=\"num\">32 GB</td><td class=\"num\">16 GB</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Storage</td><td class=\"num\">512 GB</td><td class=\"num\">1024 GB</td><td class=\"num\">256 GB</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Ports</td><td>2x USB-C, HDMI, headphone</td><td>2x USB-C, 3x USB-A, HDMI, Ethernet, SD card</td><td>2x USB-C, headphone</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Best for</td><td>Travel and everyday work</td><td>Video editing, 3D and gaming</td><td>Students and light office work</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stack\">\n    <h2>Value at a glance</h2>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3\">\n      <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"stat-label\">Price per GB of storage</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-value\">$2.54 / $1.85 / $3.90</div>\n        <p class=\"small\">Aero 14 / Forge 16 / Nimbus 13. The Forge offers the most storage per dollar; the Nimbus has the least.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"stat-label\">Price per battery hour</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-value\">$72 / $211 / $45</div>\n        <p class=\"small\">The Nimbus gives the most battery per dollar. The Forge costs the most to run unplugged.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"stat-label\">Price premium over Nimbus</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-value\">+$300 / +$900</div>\n        <p class=\"small\"><span class=\"up\">Aero 14 +30%</span> and <span class=\"up\">Forge 16 +90%</span> compared with the Nimbus 13 base price.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stack\">\n    <h2>Charts</h2>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3\">\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Price (USD)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":1299},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":1899},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":999}]}'></div>\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Battery life (hours)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":18},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":9},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":22}]}'></div>\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Weight (kg)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":1.2},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":2.1},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":1.0}]}'></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Customer rating (out of 5)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":4.6},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":4.4},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":4.2}]}'></div>\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"pie\",\"title\":\"Share of reviews (5,110 total)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14 (1,840)\",\"value\":1840},{\"label\":\"Forge 16 (960)\",\"value\":960},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13 (2,310)\",\"value\":2310}]}'></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stack\">\n    <h2>Pros and cons</h2>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3\">\n      <div class=\"card stack\">\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Aero 14 <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">4.6 rating</span></div>\n        <p class=\"small\"><strong>Pros</strong></p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Gorgeous OLED panel</li>\n          <li>Great battery</li>\n          <li>Quiet under load</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p class=\"small\"><strong>Cons</strong></p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Soldered RAM</li>\n          <li>Glossy screen</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card stack\">\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Forge 16 <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">4.4 rating</span></div>\n        <p class=\"small\"><strong>Pros</strong></p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Fastest of the three</li>\n          <li>Upgradeable RAM and SSD</li>\n          <li>Full port selection</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p class=\"small\"><strong>Cons</strong></p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Heavy</li>\n          <li>Fans are audible</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card stack\">\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Nimbus 13 <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">4.2 rating</span></div>\n        <p class=\"small\"><strong>Pros</strong></p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Lightest</li>\n          <li>Best battery life</li>\n          <li>Lowest price</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p class=\"small\"><strong>Cons</strong></p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Dimmer screen</li>\n          <li>Small SSD</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Ports</div>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <strong>Aero 14 <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">3 ports</span></strong>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">2x USB-C</span><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">HDMI</span><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Headphone</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <strong>Forge 16 <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">5 ports</span></strong>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">2x USB-C</span><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">3x USB-A</span><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">HDMI</span><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Ethernet</span><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">SD card</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <strong>Nimbus 13 <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">2 ports</span></strong>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">2x USB-C</span><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Headphone</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"small muted\">The Nimbus 13 has no HDMI or Ethernet. Use a USB-C hub if you need them.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Choose by use case</div>\n    <table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr><th>If you need…</th><th>Choose</th><th>Why</th></tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>Travel and long days away from a charger</td><td><strong>Nimbus 13</strong> or <strong>Aero 14</strong></td><td>Both weigh about 1 to 1.2 kg. The Nimbus lasts 22 h and the Aero 18 h.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Premium screen for work and media</td><td><strong>Aero 14</strong></td><td>OLED panel with a 4.6 rating, though the glossy finish may reflect light.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Video editing, 3D or gaming</td><td><strong>Forge 16</strong></td><td>16-core CPU, 32 GB RAM, 1 TB storage and a 165 Hz screen. Upgradeable later.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Lowest cost for school or office</td><td><strong>Nimbus 13</strong></td><td>$999 with the best battery and the most reviews. Watch the 256 GB storage.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Future RAM and storage upgrades</td><td><strong>Forge 16</strong></td><td>The only model with upgradeable RAM and SSD. The Aero's RAM is soldered.</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </section>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var picks = {\n    balance: \"<strong>Aero 14</strong> offers the best balance of weight, battery life, screen and rating for everyday work.\",\n    portability: \"<strong>Nimbus 13</strong> is the lightest at 1.0 kg with the longest battery (22 h). <strong>Aero 14</strong> is a close second at 1.2 kg and 18 h.\",\n    budget: \"<strong>Nimbus 13</strong> costs $999, which is $300 less than the Aero 14 and $900 less than the Forge 16. It has the most reviews (2,310).\",\n    performance: \"<strong>Forge 16</strong> has the 16-core CPU, 32 GB RAM, 1 TB storage and a 165 Hz screen. Expect a 9 h battery and 2.1 kg weight in return.\"\n  };\n  var select = document.getElementById(\"priority\");\n  var out = document.getElementById(\"pick\");\n  if (select && out) {\n    select.addEventListener(\"change\", function () {\n      out.innerHTML = picks[select.value] || picks.balance;\n    });\n  }\n})();\n</script>","deltas":[[5239,"<div class=\"page stack"],[5239,"\">\n  <header"],[5239," class=\"stack g"],[5239,"ap-sm\">\n    <"],[5239,"h1>Comp"],[5239,"are laptops: Aer